502	// resolveCellAPIBaseURL is the home-jurisdiction fallback cell resolver: it
503	// lists the caller's clusters and picks the apiUrl for `jurisdiction` (default
504	// cluster first). It hand-parses GET /api/v1/clusters rather than reusing the
505	// generated coreapi.ListClusters() because coreapi imports this (auth) package,
